## Project Overview

This is a comprehensive web UI tool for managing AWS Instance Scheduler configurations. It replaces manual DynamoDB table edits and complex CLI commands with an intuitive React-based dashboard.

### What is AWS Instance Scheduler?

AWS Instance Scheduler is an AWS solution that automates starting/stopping EC2 and RDS instances based on schedules to reduce costs. It stores configuration in a DynamoDB table but lacks a user interface.

### What This Dashboard Provides

- Visual schedule and period management
- Instance discovery across accounts/regions
- Real-time cost savings analytics
- Schedule forecasting and validation
- Modern React UI with Material-UI

