- [ ] Enable API Gateway API keys
- [ ] Use AWS WAF for API Gateway
- [ ] Enable CloudTrail logging
- [ ] Scan dependencies with `npm audit`
- [ ] Enable S3 bucket encryption (already done)
- [ ] Use HTTPS only (already done via CloudFront)
- [ ] Review IAM policies for least privilege (already done)
- [ ] Enable MFA for AWS account

